{
  "format": "srwb",
  "format_version": "1.0",
  "exported_at": "2026-08-15T15:23:43.437Z",
  "notebook": {
    "id": "default",
    "name": "Vitrine do ggplot2",
    "autoNameNumber": null,
    "description": "",
    "kernelLanguage": "r",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 13,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# Vitrine do ggplot2\n\nGráficos interativos com ggplot2 utilizando o tema escuro do SciREPL — aplicado automaticamente, sem necessidade de configuração adicional.\n\nUtiliza conjuntos de dados integrados do R (`mpg`, `mtcars`). Nenhum download de dados é necessário.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "install.packages(\"ggplot2\")\nlibrary(ggplot2)\ncat(\"ggplot2 carregado — theme_scirepl() aplicado automaticamente\\n\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "ggplot2 carregado — theme_scirepl() aplicado automaticamente",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">ggplot2 carregado — theme_scirepl() aplicado automaticamente</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "## 1. Gráfico de Dispersão com Linha de Tendência",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(displ, hwy, color = class)) +\n  geom_point(size = 2, alpha = 0.7) +\n  geom_smooth(method = \"lm\", se = FALSE, color = \"#58a6ff\") +\n  labs(title = \"Tamanho do motor vs MPG na estrada\",\n       x = \"Cilindrada (L)\", y = \"MPG na estrada\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "`geom_smooth()` using formula = 'y ~ x'",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">`geom_smooth()` using formula = 'y ~ x'</pre><img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/18945241-01d6-46d5-9aa0-27f184481324\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "## 2. Gráfico de Barras em Painéis (Faceted)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(class, fill = drv)) +\n  geom_bar(position = \"dodge\") +\n  facet_wrap(~year) +\n  labs(title = \"Classes de veículos por tipo de tração (1999 vs 2008)\",\n       x = \"Classe\", y = \"Contagem\") +\n  theme(axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 45, hjust = 1))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/c15b9f3d-71bf-4b89-8a1a-c47ae2ad56ff\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "## 3. Gráfico de Densidade",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(hwy, fill = drv)) +\n  geom_density(alpha = 0.5) +\n  labs(title = \"Distribuição de MPG na estrada por tipo de tração\",\n       x = \"MPG na estrada\", y = \"Densidade\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/e26d3e87-002e-41e0-b00c-705729fb518e\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "## 4. Boxplot com Dispersão de Pontos (Jitter)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(class, hwy, fill = class)) +\n  geom_boxplot(alpha = 0.7, show.legend = FALSE) +\n  geom_jitter(width = 0.2, alpha = 0.3, size = 1) +\n  labs(title = \"MPG na estrada por classe de veículo\",\n       x = \"Classe\", y = \"MPG na estrada\") +\n  coord_flip()",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/c00cf1a0-528d-4e8f-969a-e5a59ed59fac\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "code": "## 5. Mapa de Calor de Correlação",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "code": "corr <- round(cor(mtcars), 2)\nvars <- colnames(mtcars)\ngrid <- expand.grid(x = vars, y = vars)\ngrid$value <- as.vector(corr)\nggplot(grid, aes(x, y, fill = value)) +\n  geom_tile(color = \"#30363d\") +\n  geom_text(aes(label = ifelse(abs(value) > 0.5, value, \"\")),\n            color = \"#e6edf3\", size = 2.5) +\n  scale_fill_gradient2(low = \"#f85149\", mid = \"#161b22\", high = \"#58a6ff\",\n                       midpoint = 0, limits = c(-1, 1)) +\n  labs(title = \"Mapa de calor de correlação mtcars\", fill = \"r\") +\n  theme(axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 45, hjust = 1))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/eb6c3d15-6dc0-460c-9791-9277cad6ed47\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "code": "## Resumo\n\nTodos os gráficos acima utilizam `theme_scirepl()`, aplicado automaticamente quando o ggplot2 é carregado no SciREPL.\n\nPersonalize qualquer gráfico com as sobreposições padrão de `+ theme(...)` do ggplot2.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      }
    ]
  }
}